<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Broker cuts Peugeot figures.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Broker cuts Peugeot figures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for French carmaker PSA Peugeot Citroen were cut at Goldman Sachs, in the wake of an analyst meeting following disappointing results last week, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>For 1997, Goldman cut to 7.9 francs per share from 34.9 and for 1998 it cut to 32.5 francs from 94.8. It repeated a &quot;market underperformer&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
